							<Name>GVL_MenteeMotorV32_OS.nSlaveState</Name>
							<Comment><![CDATA[ EtherCAT AL state of the Motor Slave V3.2 ("Box 1 (Motor Slave)").
 >>> LINK IN XAE: <Motor Slave> > InfoData > State  ->  this variable. <<<
 The EtherCAT master updates it every cycle (no ADS/FB needed). Decode:
 low nibble = AL state (1=INIT, 2=PREOP, 4=SAFEOP, 8=OP), bit 4 = error.]]></Comment>
